      "prompt": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "Data set A: 2, 2, 2, 5, 5, 8, 11, 11, 14, 14, 14\nData set $B$: 2, 5, 5, 8, 8, 8, 8, 8, 11, 11, 14\nData set A. and data set $B$. each have 11 values. Which of the following statements best compares\nthe median of data set A. and the median of data set $B$?"
